# The test streams are binary -- opus_demo's packet format and OpusHead
# blobs, NUL bytes in their first few -- and are named as such rather than
# left to text=auto's inference (the root .gitattributes says why): one
# translated byte would make a stream decode to something libopus never
# heard, and every digest in references.txt would fail at once.
*.bit  binary
*.head binary
